timization","content":"**DOM Output:**"},"567":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-105","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Performance Benefits:**"},"568":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-106","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"},"569":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-107","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"},"570":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-108","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"},"571":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-109","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Trade-offs:**"},"572":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-110","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"},"573":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-111","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"},"574":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-112","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#recommendations","content":"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"},"575":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-113","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#recommendations","content":"*