e or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/components/select-21","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/components/select-22","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/components/select-23","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/components/select-24","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/components/select-25","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#default","content":"Minimal usage with a `Label`, items, and a placeholder."},"1168":{"id":"/docs/components/select-26","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"1169":{"id":"/docs/components/select-27","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#multiple","content":"Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values. `value` is an array of keys."},"1170":{"id":"/docs/components/select-28","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#invalid","content":"Use `isInv