Screen readers"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-12","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#decorative-icons","content":"Decorative icons"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-13","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#indicator-dot","content":"Indicator dot"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-14","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-15","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"When to Use"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-16","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#when-not-to-use","content":"When Not to Use"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-17","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#props","content":"Props"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-18","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#tag","content":"Tag"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-19","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#default","content":"A minimal tag with the default emphasis and size."},"1341":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-20","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#emphasis","content":"Nine emphasis options are available. Choose the one that fits the visual tone of your context."},"1342":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-21","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#sizes","content":"Choose a size that fits the surrounding content. Smaller tags work well in compact layouts like tables; larger tags suit headings or hero sections."},"1343":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-22","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#inline","content":"Use `design=\"inline\"` to embed a tag within a sentence. The background and border are removed so the tag blends into the text flow."},"1344":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-23","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#high-contrast","content":"A bolder color treatment for when tags need to stand out more - for example, on colored backgrounds."},"1345":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-24","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#with-icon","content":"Icons reinforce the tag's meaning at a glance. Add an `Icon` as a child - it inherits the tag's color and scales with its size."},"1346":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-25","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#indicator","content":"A minimal style that pairs a small colored dot with a neutral background. Well suited for dense layouts like tables or dashboards where multiple tags in close proximity would otherwise compete for attention."},"1347":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-26","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#screen-readers","content":"Tags are `<span>` elements with no special ARIA role. Screen readers announce the tag's text as part of normal page content — no extra markup is needed."},"1348":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-27","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#decorative-icons","content":"Icons passed as children must include `aria-hidden=\"true\"` so they are skipped by screen readers. The text label is the sole carrier of meaning."},"1349":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-28","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#indicator-dot","content":"The colored dot is decorative and invisible to screen readers. The text label must convey the status on its own — never rely on the dot alone to communicate meaning."},"1350":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-29","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Use the indicator style in dense layouts like tables and dashboards. Use the filled style when the tag is a prominent, standalone element on a card or hero section."},"1351":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-30","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Default to the small size in compact layouts like tables and lists. Use medium or large only when the tag needs to stand out as a primary piece of information."},"1352":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-31","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Use the inline design only within running prose. In grouped or standalone contexts, the filled style provides better visual separation."},"1353":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-32","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#best-practices","content":"Do not stack multiple tags of different emphasis on the same item. Choose the most important one — too many competing labels lose their meaning."},"1354":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-33","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Showing the status of an item on a card, table row, or list entry (e.g. \"Active\", \"Expired\", \"Pending\")"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-34","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Categorizing or grouping content so users can scan and filter quickly (e.g. \"New\", \"Sale\", \"Beta\")"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-35","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Surfacing metadata about an item (e.g. \"Pro\", \"Free trial\", \"Internal\")"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-36","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-to-use","content":"Communicating priority or category in project management and collaboration tools (e.g. \"High priority\", \"In review\")"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-37","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-not-to-use","content":"If users need to click or dismiss it — use a **Button** instead."},"1359":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-38","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag#when-not-to-use","content":"If the label is part of a sentence with no visual distinction — just use text."},"1360":{"id":"/docs/components/text","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"page","content":"Text","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/components/text-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text","content":"Text component for displaying and formatting text content with alignment and truncation options"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/components/text-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#installation","content":"Installation"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/components/text-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#examples","content":"Examples"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/components/text-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#default","content":"Default"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/components/text-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#as","content":"As"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/components/text-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#align","content":"Align"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/components/text-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#max-lines","content":"Max Lines"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/components/text-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#wrap","content":"Wrap"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/components/text-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#props","content":"Props"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/components/text-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text#text","content":"Text"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/components/text-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text","content":"The `Text` component prepares content with a few properties."},"1372":{"id":"/docs/components/text-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#default","content":"Basic text content."},"1373":{"id":"/docs/components/text-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#as","content":"Setting the `as` prop allows you to change the HTML tag of the `Text` component."},"1374":{"id":"/docs/components/text-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#align","content":"Setting the `align` prop allows you to change the alignment of the text. Choose from `start`, `center`, `end`, or `justify`; the logical keywords support RTL languages."},"1375":{"id":"/docs/components/text-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#max-lines","content":"Setting the `maxLines` prop limits the number of displayed lines using an ellipsis."},"1376":{"id":"/docs/components/text-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text#wrap","content":"Setting the `wrap` prop controls text wrapping with values such as `wrap`, `nowrap`, `balance`, `pretty`, or `stable`."},"1377":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"page","content":"TextArea","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area","content":"Multiline text control for use inside a field."},"1379":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#installation","content":"Installation"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#examples","content":"Examples"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#default","content":"Default"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#props","content":"Props"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-area#textarea","content":"TextArea"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area","content":"`TextArea` is the multiline control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` as the parent; see that component for fuller examples."},"1385":{"id":"/docs/components/text-area-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-area","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-area#default","content":"TextArea inside TextField."},"1386":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"page","content":"TextField","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field","content":"TextField is a composed single-line or multiline text input. Use it in forms for short answers (email, search, name) or longer content (comments)."},"1388":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"Features"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#installation","content":"Installation"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#examples","content":"Examples"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#default","content":"Default"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#invalid","content":"Invalid"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#adornments","content":"Adornments"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#multiline","content":"Multiline"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#controls-and-icons","content":"Controls and icons"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#telephone-field","content":"Telephone Field"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#blocks","content":"Blocks"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#props","content":"Props"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-field#textfield","content":"TextField"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-16","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-17","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#default","content":"Minimal usage: a `Label` and an `Input`."},"1410":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"1411":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"1412":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"1413":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#adornments","content":"Fixed text before and after the input, such as currency. Leading and trailing content is\ncomposed inside the `Group` and its position comes from source order."},"1414":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#multiline","content":"Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry."},"1415":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#sizes","content":"Compare the supported `md` and `sm` visual sizes, plain and with an icon plus control button.\nSet `size` on `TextField` so the input and `Button slot=\"control\"` share the same size."},"1416":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#controls-and-icons","content":"Put a control or an icon beside the input. A `Button slot=\"control\"` is an\ninteractive affix; static content is wrapped in a `Flex as=\"span\"` to center it and give it a gutter."},"1417":{"id":"/docs/components/text-field-30","page_id":"/docs/components/text-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-field#telephone-field","content":"Compose a telephone number input paired with a country-code select."},"1418":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"page","content":"TextLockup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-0","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup","content":"TextLockup stacks an eyebrow, title, and body text as one coordinated type group across six sizes."},"1420":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-1","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Features"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-2","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#installation","content":"Installation"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-3","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#examples","content":"Examples"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-4","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#default","content":"Default"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-5","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-6","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#tag-eyebrow","content":"Tag Eyebrow"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-7","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#alignment","content":"Alignment"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-8","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#legible-lines","content":"Legible Lines"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-9","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#with-actions","content":"With Actions"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-10","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"Customization"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-11","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-12","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-13","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#props","content":"Props"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-14","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#textlockup","content":"TextLockup"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-15","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Six coordinated sizes, from a `2xl` page title down to `xs`"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-16","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"An eyebrow that takes plain text or a `Tag`, sized to match the lockup"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-17","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Slotted parts, so nested components keep their own type"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-18","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Any heading level, chosen independently of the visual size"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-19","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"Start or center alignment"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-20","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#features","content":"A legible line-length clamp, on by default"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-21","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#default","content":"A lockup stacks an optional eyebrow, a title and body text as one coordinated type\ngroup. You supply the parts, so the title can be any heading level and the body any\nnumber of paragraphs; `size` sets the tier for all of them at once."},"1441":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-22","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#sizes","content":"`size` is the tier: the eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`,\nand the body on `body`. Use `2xl` for a page title, `xl` for a hero, `lg` for a section\ntitle, and `md` (the default) everywhere else."},"1442":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-23","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#tag-eyebrow","content":"The eyebrow takes either plain text or a `Tag`. Both use `slot=\"eyebrow\"`, so the two\nforms swap freely, and the lockup pairs the tag's `size` with its own."},"1443":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-24","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#alignment","content":"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."},"1444":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-25","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#legible-lines","content":"The text parts are constrained to a comfortable line length by default. Set\n`legibleLines={false}` to let them run the full width of their container, which suits a\nlockup already inside a narrow column. Both lockups below share one wide container, so the\nclamp is what makes the first one narrower."},"1445":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-26","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#with-actions","content":"Because you compose the parts, anything else can sit alongside them — a call to action\nhere. Controls keep their own type: the buttons are unaffected by the lockup's `size`."},"1446":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-27","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"`TextLockup` positions and type-sets its parts; you supply them. That means anything else can\nsit alongside them — a call to action, a second paragraph, an image — without the component\ngrowing a prop for it."},"1447":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-28","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Anything unslotted is\nleft alone, which is what lets a nested component keep its own internal text. Forget the slot\nand the text simply renders untypeset rather than erroring."},"1448":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-29","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."},"1449":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-30","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."},"1450":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-31","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."},"1451":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-32","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."},"1452":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-33","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."},"1453":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-34","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize."},"1454":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-35","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#customization","content":"Pass `className` to extend the styles, or select on `[data-size]` and `[data-align]`."},"1455":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-36","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"The title carries the heading semantics. Choose `level` so the page outline stays correct\nrather than to achieve a size."},"1456":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-37","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"Slots resolve against the lockup, so `slot=\"title\"` names the lockup's title, not an outer\ncontainer's. Inside a\n`Modal`, `Drawer` or `Popover`, give the dialog its own `<Heading slot=\"title\">` as a direct\nchild for the accessible name, and use the lockup for the body."},"1457":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-38","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#accessibility","content":"The eyebrow is decorative in most designs. If it carries meaning, make sure the title still\nreads sensibly on its own, since screen reader users often navigate by heading."},"1458":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-39","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Use one `2xl` lockup per page at most — it is the page title."},"1459":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-40","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Keep `legibleLines` on for running prose. Turn it off only when the lockup already sits in a\nnarrow column, where the clamp does nothing but complicate the layout."},"1460":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-41","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Prefer a `Tag` eyebrow for status or category, and plain text for a kicker or section label."},"1461":{"id":"/docs/components/text-lockup-42","page_id":"/docs/components/text-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/text-lockup#best-practices","content":"Reach for `MetricsLockup` instead when the emphasis is a single number rather than prose."},"1462":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"page","content":"ToggleButton","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-0","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button","content":"Accessible toggle button component for grouped contextual actions with single or multiple selection, keyboard navigation, and RTL-aware layouts."},"1464":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-1","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#installation","content":"Installation"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-2","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#examples","content":"Examples"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-3","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#default","content":"Default"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-4","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#multiple-selection","content":"Multiple Selection"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-5","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-6","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#disabled-states","content":"Disabled States"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-7","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-8","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon--text","content":"Icon + Text"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-9","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only","content":"Icon Only"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-10","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#with-dropdown","content":"With Dropdown"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-11","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#rtl-direction","content":"RTL Direction"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-12","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#customization","content":"Customization"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-13","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"Data Attributes"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-14","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#component-customization","content":"Component Customization"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-15","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-16","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Keyboard Navigation"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-17","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"ARIA Support"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-18","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-19","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#selection-not-updating","content":"Selection Not Updating"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-20","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#styling-overrides-not-applying","content":"Styling Overrides Not Applying"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-21","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation-not-working","content":"Keyboard Navigation Not Working"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-22","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-23","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"When to Use"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-24","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keep-variants-consistent","content":"Keep Variants Consistent"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-25","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#balance-label-lengths","content":"Balance Label Lengths"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-26","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"Alignment"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-27","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Label Guidelines"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-28","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only-items","content":"Icon-Only Items"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-29","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#props","content":"Props"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-30","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#togglebuttongroup","content":"ToggleButtonGroup"},"1494":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-31","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#togglebutton","content":"ToggleButton"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-32","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#default","content":"A `ToggleButton` toggles between selected and unselected. Wrap multiple inside a `ToggleButtonGroup` to link them with shared selection and keyboard navigation."},"1496":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-33","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#multiple-selection","content":"Use `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow more than one item to be active at a time."},"1497":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-34","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#controlled","content":"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` to control selection from parent state."},"1498":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-35","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#disabled-states","content":"Disable the entire group with `isDisabled` on the container, or disable individual items with `isDisabled` on specific `ToggleButton` elements."},"1499":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-36","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#sizes","content":"Two sizes are available: `sm` and `md` (default)."},"1500":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-37","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon--text","content":"Items can include an `Icon` alongside text for added visual context."},"1501":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-38","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only","content":"For compact layouts, items can contain only icons. Always provide an `aria-label` on each icon-only item."},"1502":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-39","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#with-dropdown","content":"Wrap a `ToggleButton` in a `MenuTrigger` to add sub-options to a group item."},"1503":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-40","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#rtl-direction","content":"The group follows the document's layout direction, detected automatically from the browser locale."},"1504":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-41","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1505":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-42","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-43","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#data-attributes","content":"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"},"1507":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-44","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#component-customization","content":"Individual components can be styled by passing `className` props:"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-45","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Key"},"1509":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-46","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Action"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-47","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-48","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Moves focus to/from the button group (single tab stop)"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-49","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Left / Right**"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-50","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus between items (RAC automatically reverses in RTL)"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-51","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space / Enter**"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-52","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Toggle the focused item"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-53","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Home**"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-54","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the first item"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-55","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**End**"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-56","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the last item"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-57","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-58","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"},"1522":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-59","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"},"1523":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-60","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"Icon-only items require `aria-label` on each `ToggleButton`"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-61","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For grouped contextual actions — two or more closely related actions that belong together (e.g. Bold / Italic / Underline, Align Left / Center / Right)"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-62","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For compact action grouping — related actions in space-constrained layouts (e.g. Undo / Redo, Zoom In / Out / Reset)"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-63","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For multi-select scenarios — when users need to select multiple options simultaneously"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-64","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For unrelated actions that perform disconnected tasks without shared context"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-65","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For more than 5 choices — cognitive overload; consider a **Select** instead"},"1529":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-66","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When actions require strong visual distinction (e.g. Save vs. Delete)"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-67","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When selecting an option leads to a different page or workflow — use navigation instead"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-68","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For mutually exclusive content views (e.g. Monthly / Yearly) — use **SegmentedController** instead"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-69","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keep-variants-consistent","content":"Avoid mixing different content types (text-only, icon-only, icon+text) within the same group. Mixing styles creates visual noise and makes the set feel fragmented rather than unified."},"1533":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-70","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#balance-label-lengths","content":"Keep button labels of similar length. Large differences in text length cause irregular button widths and make the group appear uneven. Prefer short, concise wording."},"1534":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-71","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"Align 