int event"],[505,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1403,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[368,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1159,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[805,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1161,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[674,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[576,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[672,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[808,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1163,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1406,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1452,"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."],[1405,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[1863,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1653,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1652,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1709,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[564,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1650,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[566,"**DOM Output:**"],[1518,"**End**"],[511,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1447,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Anything unslotted is\nleft alone, which is what lets a nested component keep its own internal text. Forget the slot\nand the text simply renders untypeset rather than erroring."],[582,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[570,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[555,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[504,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1165,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[558,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1668,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1680,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1516,"**Home**"],[1683,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1672,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1862,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1853,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[533,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[573,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1651,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[197,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[196,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1675,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[673,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1535,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1708,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[569,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1670,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[586,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1674,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1407,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[580,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[955,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[502,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[567,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[584,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[577,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1000,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[999,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[675,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1166,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1890,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[568,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[563,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1649,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1681,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1537,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1654,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1679,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1676,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1126,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1127,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1187,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[202,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1710,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1647,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1162,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[671,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1514,"**Space / Enter**"],[1005,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[201,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[719,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1130,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[562,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[572,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1194,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[806,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon, `variant=\"control\"`, and `size` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1684,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1673,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[512,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[556,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1510,"**Tab**"],[200,"**Tab**: 